      <h2>6. What stretches the clock: the hidden water</h2>
      <p>
        The gap between a sailing schedule and the day your buyer receives the goods comes from a
        small number of controllable and uncontrollable factors. Control the documents and SABER
        timing; plan around the schedule, season and security variables.
      </p>
