      <div class="note mt-2">
        <strong>The controllable half:</strong> obtain the SABER SC before arrival, file the FASAH
        pre-arrival declaration early, classify the HS code correctly and book trucking before
        discharge. Those steps remove the clearance hold that turns a routine arrival into a delayed
        delivery.
